        "Hvaða sérlitur? (t.d. Pantone 300 C)"@is,
        "どの特色ですか？（例：Pantone 300 C）"@ja,
        "Hvilken spotfarge? (f.eks. Pantone 300 C)"@nb,
        "Welke steunkleur? (bv. Pantone 300 C)"@nl,
        "Który kolor dodatkowy? (np. Pantone 300 C)"@pl,
        "Que cor direta? (p. ex. Pantone 300 C)"@pt,
        "Vilken dekorfärg? (t.ex. Pantone 300 C)"@sv,
        "哪种专色？（例如 Pantone 300 C）"@zh-Hans ;
